  "content": {
    "text": "CONCLUDED\nLast Updated:\n22 hours ago\nApple Shows Off Agentic AI Updates\nIt's not just Siri that's getting an AI update.\nApple shared multiple AI updates coming to Safari and other apps. These updates stand out, as the AI will act as an agent, taking actions for the users.\nSafari will be able to organize open web tabs into topics. The web browser will analyze different pages, identify similarities, and then bring related tabs together. Safari will also be able to send alerts to a user about an update that happens on a web page, even if the page is closed.",
    "text_blocks": [
      "CONCLUDED",
      "Last Updated:",
      "22 hours ago",
      "Apple Shows Off Agentic AI Updates",
      "It's not just Siri that's getting an AI update.",
      "Apple shared multiple AI updates coming to Safari and other apps. These updates stand out, as the AI will act as an agent, taking actions for the users.",
      "Safari will be able to organize open web tabs into topics. The web browser will analyze different pages, identify similarities, and then bring related tabs together. Safari will also be able to send alerts to a user about an update that happens on a web page, even if the page is closed."
